It is winter in Copenhagen.
I am walking down the street.
The wind is very cold.
It is blowing hard today.
I lean against the cold wind.
I pull my scarf up.
My face is freezing.
I look around.
I would like to get into the warmth.
I see a small café on the corner.
The windows are fogged up.
It looks warm in there.
I walk over to the café.
I open the heavy door.
I step inside.
It smells like coffee here.
The air is nice and warm.
I close the door behind me.
The cold wind stays outside.
